==Albanian==

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|sq|mbasi}}
* {{alter|sq|masi}} {{i|Gheg}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|sq|pas||after, behind, at, beyond}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sq|/paːsi/}}

===Conjunction===
{{l|sq|pasi}}

# [[after]] ([[then]])
# [[when]], [[since]]
# [[because]]
# [[as]], [[if]]

Example:
* '''''Pasi''' erdhën të gjithë, filloi mbledhja.''
** '''''[[after|After]]''' everyone came, the meeting began''
* '''''Pasi''' qenka puna kështu, unë po iki.''
** '''''[[since|Since]]''' this is (apparently) the case, '''[[then]]''' I'm leaving.''
* '''''Pasi''' ajo nuk po vjen edhe unë do të rri.''
** '''''[[if|If]]''' she is not coming '''[[then]]''' I'll stay too.''

